ace Force, turned into a sci-fi turn-based strategy game set in a nebulous future. Train for your selections or just enjoy the dive in this immersive experience where the goal is to take the best decisions to survive.","steam_appid":2659750,"support_info":{"email":"cockpitseeker@hotmail.com","url":"https://cockpitseeker.com/eopn/test-rs/"},"supported_languages":"French<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://cockpitseeker.com/eopn/test-rs/"}